<p>The cost of a filling depends on its size and how many surfaces of the tooth it covers. We accept most major PPO plans, check your benefits before treatment, and give you a written estimate. New patients without insurance can start with our <a href="/special-offers/">$49 new-patient exam and X-rays</a>, and we offer Cherry financing and in-house payment plans. See <a href="/insurance-financing/">insurance and financing</a> for details.</p>

